{"id":"716a176673d9ea45","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-convergence-soundness.md","title":"Soundness of Convergence Schemes","display":"thm-convergence-soundness — Soundness of Convergence Schemes","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-convergence-soundness","aliases":["89-thm-convergence-soundness"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-convergence-soundness — Soundness of Convergence Schemes","depends_on":["[[89-df-convergent-frame]]","[[89-lem-modal-path-semantics]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-convergence-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-convergence-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-convergence-soundness — Soundness of Convergence Schemes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e81fa800505e986\" href=\"?note=3e81fa800505e986\" title=\"89-df-convergent-frame\">89-df-convergent-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"084fa6cdd966d3ef\" href=\"?note=084fa6cdd966d3ef\" title=\"89-lem-modal-path-semantics\">89-lem-modal-path-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为 Kripke 框架；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j,m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}\\)</span> 是四索引收敛谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\models A\">\\(F\\models A\\)</span> 量化所有赋值和世界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\\Longrightarrow\nF\\models(\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\\Longrightarrow\nF\\models(\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 89；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>任取赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 及世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>。前件提供 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wR^ix\">\\(wR^ix\\)</span> 且在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 步后继处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 真。任取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wR^jy\">\\(wR^jy\\)</span>，收敛给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xR^mz\">\\(xR^mz\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"yR^nz\">\\(yR^nz\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 真，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^n A\">\\(\\Diamond^n A\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 满足后件。这包括任一索引为零的情况。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-convergent-frame","status":"resolved","id":"3e81fa800505e986","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-convergent-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-modal-path-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"084fa6cdd966d3ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-modal-path-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j,m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conv}_{i,j,m,n}(F)\\Longrightarrow\nF\\models(\\Diamond^i\\Box^m A\\to\\Box^j\\Diamond^n A).","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"wR^ix","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"wR^jy","display":false},{"tex":"xR^mz","display":false},{"tex":"yR^nz","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond^n A","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false}],"bytes":1180,"backlinks":[{"id":"852a0356bca26d3a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-485","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-convergence-soundness]]"}],"outgoing":["3e81fa800505e986","084fa6cdd966d3ef","dbba58e7bd3b0667"]}